    "summary": "PowerCompute's strategic energy management and debt reduction enhance profitability, but declining Bitcoin value poses revenue challenges.\nThe post PowerCompute boosts Bitcoin mining output by 36% in Q3 2026 appeared first on Crypto Briefing.",
